# 0夜 に Alice (占) が Bob (狐) を占い → 呪殺 → fox_kill event。
# Day 1 投票で Carol (狼) 処刑 → 即終局 (終局のための最小投票、 検証対象外)。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=占い師
!Bob=妖狐
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Alice 0夜 占い Bob

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# fox_kill (divine curse): Bob
# == end ==

Alice→Carol
Dave→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Carol 2 / Alice 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Alice, Dave
# == end ==

# @expect-event fox_kill target:Bob
